    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25705.png",
      "text": "ኣብ ሓደ ዓዲ ሓደ ዝብእን ሓደ ኣድግን ነበሩ፡፡ እዞም እንስሳት ብሃንደበት ተላለዩ፡፡ ኣብ መንጎኦም ድማ ዕርክነት ክምስርቱን ሓቢሮም ክነብሩን ጀመሩ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3d5f49bd48f38ef572659b20846cc244f286287f678f7e8e6b3a64b203c05c01"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25706.png",
      "text": "ውዕል ስምምዕነት ድማ ኣብ መንጎኦም ከምዘድሊ ተሰማምዑ፡፡ ውዕሎም ድማ ሓቢርና ፀላእትና ክንከላኸል ፣ ዝረኸብናዮ ሓቢርና ክንበልዕን ክንሰትን ዝብሉ ነበሩ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:972bbb675b36d8e82b4b7e0a2183b3266e58935bb50d0e3b02fed1e4e40f5bba"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25707.png",
      "text": "ዝብእን ኣድግን በቲ ውዕሎም መሰረት ድማ ሓቢሮም ይነብሩ፤ ከምኡውን ብሓባር ኩሉ ዓይነት ስራሕ ይሰርሑ ነይሮም፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:9d86a3832a8c16e3c5104f05d26d85fed091637d57c0d4657cd2808d609c335d"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25708.png",
      "text": "ሓቢሮም እንትነብሩ ፣ እንትነብሩ፣ ሓደ መዓልቲ ክልቲኦም ብሓባር ፣ «ማይ ክንሰቲ ናብ ሩባ ንኺ ድ» ተበሃሃሉ፡፡ ናብቲ ማይ ዝርከበሉ ቦታ ድማ እናተፃወቱ ኸዱ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8169a1e4cbfe3411f9210d932ed2721941abe2ae7970dd9914b6bc08ae3f7af0"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25709.png",
      "text": "ኣድጊ ጐይዩ ብምውራድ ፣ ኣብቲ ሩባ ምስ በፅሐ ትሕት ኢሉ ኣብ ዝርከብ ወሓዚ ማይ ደኒኑ እንትሰቲ ፣ ዝብኢ ድማ ደድሕሪኡ ተኸቲሉ ኣርከቦ እሞ ብልዕሊኡ ኰይኑ ሰተየ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:516f67d8eaf75f67c3d7f11c3be7f3915452e5b57185066bf62e97653e8f072d"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25710.png",
      "text": "ድሕሪ ሒደት ደቓይቕ ዝብኢ ብሃንደበት ማይ ምስታይ ኣቛሪፁ ፣ «ስማዕባ ኣድጊ፥ ንምንታይ ኢኻ ዝሰትዮ ማይ ትዘርገለይ?» ብምባል ሓተቶ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3b409fdae4fe6ff5e91ba77878bbc598db7e69193231f46b75bb750d39c40baa"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25711.png",
      "text": "ኣድጊ ከም እትፈልጥዎ ፃምእ ማይ ኣይኽእልን ኣዝዩ ፀሚእዎ ስለዝነበረ ደኒኑ እናሰተየ ሰሚዑ ከምዘይሰምዐ ኣፅቀጠ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1d6a7c348ad5a3541313ad055f5cf8b86578872edc1431c967cbd737c35da7d4"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25712.png",
      "text": "ወዮ ዝብኢ ድማ ነገር ስለዝሓሰበ ንህር ኢሉ፣ «ኣንታ ዓርማም፥ ኣይነኣኻ እንድየ? ንመን ድየ ዝዛረቦ ዘለኹ?» ኢሉ ብኹራ ፀረፎ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:15b88c0713dafc70086e6957607840ff35f8a771d1bb04193ef137ef768c36db"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25713.png",
      "text": "ኣድጊ ቅንዕ ኢሉ ፣ «ኣንታ ኣያ ዝብኢ ካብ መዓዝ እዩ ማይ ንዓቐብ ዝደየበ? ኣይንስኻንዶ ብልዕለይ ዝኒሀኻ፣ ኣነ ተውሳኸይ ዝሰቲ ዘለኹ ብትሕተኻ ፣ከመይ ጌረ እየ ዝዘርገልካ?» ኢሉ ብሕቶ መለሰሉ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:382f26bf6182ef1cb366114eaa754a04ef908c729487de626bdf57cbe6ed9ac0"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25714.png",
      "text": "ዝብኢ ትቕብል ኣቢሉ ፣ «ማይ ንዓቐብ ምድያብ ዝጀመረ ኣነን ንስኻን ብዕርክነት ብሓባር ክንነብር ኣብ ዝተስማዕማዕናሉ እዋን እዩ» ብምባል ንኣድጊ ክጎብጦ ቐረበ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e035732079a4e17c9595e15dae94b8c82add3d49d7f7e2c943e3aab99f74219d"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25715.png",
      "text": "ምሽክናይ ኣብዚ ጊዜ እዙይ መንነቱ ረሲዑ ምስ ሓያል ዝዓረኸ ኣድጊ ፣ «በል ደኣ ኣያ ዝብኢ እንተይ ኣመኽነኻ ብልዐኒ» ኢሉ ተዛረቦ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3d4223732df8e72a98f60e78c86881c215473e0955107f4657c939e6703c9c96"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25716.png",
      "text": "ኣብ መወዳእታ እቲ ሃርጓፍ ዝብኢ ድማ ዘሊሉ ብረቃቒተኡ ሓዞ እሞ ፣ኣውዲቑ፤ በልዖ ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22014#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6db6d0bfcb626a3ea8c75dffe0cbcc70017ec2dfd48afedb255363976fa444ba"
    }
  ],
